  "source": "Reichelt ME089 module datasheet: 43 x 43 mm board, 27 mm tall with the heat sink. The layout follows photographs of the common module: two-way OUT1/OUT2 terminal along the bottom edge with the four flyback diodes to its left, the three-way 12V/GND/5V terminal beside it, the OUT3/OUT4 terminal along the top edge, the six logic pins down the right edge with the 5 V enable jumper below them, heat sink upper left, two electrolytic cans in the middle and the 78M05 regulator by the power terminal. Positions inside the outline are indicative, not read from a drawing: clones move components around, and the corner mounting holes visible in photos were not measured, so none are drawn. Check your board before cutting a panel.",
