    "note": "Motor supply 5 to 35 V on the 12V input; the 5V pin puts out 5 V from the onboard regulator when the jumper is on. Allow about 1 A per channel: the bipolar H-bridges drop roughly 2 V, so motors run slower than the supply suggests and the chip wants airflow at full load."
